	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>20</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>4</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Main bank account
You can now select the main bank account in the Companies catalog and the list of сompany bank accounts. You can fill in the company bank account and the counterparty bank account in contracts and documents.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>21</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>4</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Search, confirmation, and replacement of master data duplicates
New feature: tool for searching, confirming, and replacing duplicates in master data. It is adapted to the application scenarios. The tool supports the following features:
Customizable duplicate search rules.
Interactive search for duplicates and scheduling.
Interactive marking of duplicates in lists.
Responsible users can do the following with a list of duplicates in the Master data duplicates workplace:
Confirm duplicates;
Do not confirm duplicates;
Track and analyze duplicate replacement errors, and resume replacement;
Change duplicate actions.
The Duplicate cleaner SSL command is hidden from the user interface.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>22</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>3</f>
					<tl/>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
