				<c>
					<f>3</f>
					<tl/>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>24</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>2</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Sales, purchases, and warehouse</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>25</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>4</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Mobile warehouse keeper workplace
Basic scenarios of using barcode scanners without accessing interface commands are now optimized, including:</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>26</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>4</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Search for reference documents by document barcodes.
Search for documents, storage bins, or items from the Mobile warehouse keeper workplace.
Improved system behavior when scanning item or storage bin barcodes in documents.
Scanning of non-unique barcodes and search for items by batch barcode.
Offline barcode scanning.Users can still operate through the Mobile warehouse keeper workplace as in previous versions.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>27</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>4</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Delivery
New delivery management 2.5 features:</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>28</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>4</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Storing delivery addresses in the Delivery points catalog.
Planning outgoing deliveries in sales documents (Sales order, Customer invoice, and Goods shipment to customer).
Deferred planning of outgoing delivery by the Delivery order document.
Partial delivery planning based on sales documents, partial delivery planning with different parameters.
Vehicle departure planning using the Trip document with an option to reschedule delivery parameters.
Picking goods based on trip data for warehouse management.You can upgrade to delivery version 2.5 in Master data and settings .</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>29</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>3</f>
					<tl/>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>30</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>3</f>
					<tl/>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>31</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>2</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Treasury and AR/AP accounting</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>32</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>4</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Improved exchange rate accounting in documents</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>33</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>4</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>The accuracy of AR/AP accounting in currencies other than the accounting currencies is now increased.
The algorithm for calculating register record amounts in local and management accounting currencies is improved when setting off payments for invoices.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>34</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>4</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>AR/AP reconciliation dashboard
New workplace to analyze the current state of reconciliation with counterparties in Treasury . You can use it to:</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>35</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>4</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Get the current state of reconciliation with counterparties for the specified period.
Create AR/AP reconciliation documents and send them.
Track AR/AP reconciliation states.
Receive reconciliation statements from counterparties and enter discrepancies in existing reconciliation documents.
Confirm reconciliation documents for selected counterparties (set the "Reconciled without discrepancies" or "Reconciled with discrepancies" status).</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>36</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>4</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Payment schedule development
In payment schedules:</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>37</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>4</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>You can now specify a fixed payment date, which allows you to add a payment milestone without linking it to a business event and reduce the number of manual adjustments to payment schedules.
For vendor AR/AP, a calculation option from a receipt date is added, which makes it possible to distinguish between shipment and receipt.
You can calculate a payment date using the formula.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>38</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>4</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Cash forecast development
You can now set the Minimum balance and Critical balance for each bank and cash account. With new functions, you can:</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>39</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>4</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Reduce the workplace scale by up to 80%.
Process scheduled payments.
Change a payment date, bank or cash account, and split payments not only by payment requests, but also by other documents by clicking Change payment.
Apply advanced filters by clicking Advanced filter.
Postpone payments or receipts indefinitely by clicking Advanced filter .
Use color indicators for visualization.
Display regular payments under contracts with vendors in the cash forecast.
Automatically generate notes for the selected cash forecast cell and the payment details line when the specified conditions are met.New settings are added to make it easier to use the cash forecast.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>40</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>3</f>
					<tl/>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>41</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>3</f>
					<tl/>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>42</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>2</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Budgeting</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>43</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>4</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Entering opening balance of estimated budget balance items
You are now able to create a forecast balance from scratch, meaning you can enter fixed opening balances of estimates for the planned budget period, which do not depend on the actual balances of budget balance items and on planned turnovers of influencing budget flow items of previous periods.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>44</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>4</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Generating budgets according to calculation rules, without opening the form
New feature: quick calculation of large volumes of budget data without filling in and posting the Enter budget entry form documents using the Budget turnover recorder document available in the Calculate budgets by rules document journal.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>45</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>4</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>After calculating budget data for any scenario, they can be displayed in a separate budget report or used in the rules for calculating related budget balances and turnovers as a source for other budget data.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>46</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>3</f>
					<tl/>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>47</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>3</f>
					<tl/>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>48</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>2</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Manufacturing</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>49</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>4</f>
					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Summary analysis of production order readiness by phases
New feature: classifier of production process stages by production phases. It allows you to assign stages to different phases and analyze the order readiness broken down by production phases without going deeper into details. Analysis of order completion percentage by phase.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
	<rowsItem>
		<index>50</index>
		<row>
			<c>
				<c>
					<f>3</f>
					<tl/>
				</c>
			</c>
		</row>
	</rowsItem>
