					<tl>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>Sales allocation by lines of business
Sales allocation by lines of business is now improved:
You can set up allocation by inventory segments, partner segments, and warehouses.
The settings are applied to the Revenue and COGS register with recording lines of business:
In local accounting entries on subaccounts 90.x.
In financial accounting entries on sales.
In the Income and expenses — Enterprise and Enterprise gross profit reports.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
