						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>The Product cost tree report.
The Actual product cost report.
The Standard and actual costs of product by intermediate products report.
The Product standard costs (2.2) document: Document calculation for closed / partially closed production orders.
The Consumption report — Subcontracting services delivered document: the "Report on materials" print form generation.
The Consumption report — Subcontracting services delivered (2.4) document: the "Report on manufactured products and materials" print form generation.
The Data synchronization tool: preparation of data for exporting on the "Consumption report — Subcontracting services delivered" and "Consumption report — Subcontracting services delivered (2.4)" documents.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
					</tl>
