						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>ru</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>View files attached to 1C:Document Management objects in the Document management form.
View digital signatures of 1C:Document Management objects in the Document management form.
Create qualified digital signatures of 1C:Document Management documents and files using the integrated system.
Set up applicability conditions of integration rules using 1C:Enterprise language expressions. Use a check that does not allow duplicate rules with the same applicability conditions.
Optimize data exchange. If an error occurs, the system identifies successfully sent documents from the exchange message and only resends unaccepted documents on retry.
Save comments on a task before completing it.
Preview PDF files using 1C:Enterprise tools in the web client.</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
